@host = http://localhost:5080

### The converted slice (FunkyORM read model)
GET {{host}}/orders/recent?page=0

### Filtered on a joined column
GET {{host}}/orders/recent?page=0&country=Canada

### The "before" world: EF Include chain
GET {{host}}/orders/recent/ef-include?page=0

### The EF fix: projection
GET {{host}}/orders/recent/ef-projection?page=0
